      "content": "idk my doctor is always so dismissive of anything that isnt a pill... they just told me to \"wait and see\" which isn't helping. i read online that as long as you dont take them at the exact same time of day it should be fine? like if i take my warfarin in the morning and the st johns wort at night, would that fix the interaction issue?",
