      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just dont want to deal with the appointment and the hassle. i looked it up on a forum and people were saying st johns wort is super mild so it wont really do anything to my bloodthinners. honestly i just want to know if it's actually dangerous or if people are just being extra cautious. can u just give me a straight answer if they actually interact or if i'm fine to try a small dose?",
